# U.S.S. Enterprise-D's trigger asks whether charge counters were put on it for the first time this turn (CR 603.2), not
# how often it has triggered. At ten charge counters it is a creature, so Dress Down takes its abilities: Warp Core's two
# charge counters then trigger nothing. Bot2 Disenchants Dress Down while Bot1's Mox Pearl is on the stack, and Station
# puts ten more on the Enterprise, which has its trigger again - but these are not the first charge counters put on it
# this turn, so nothing is exiled: only the Island its first Station exiled two turns earlier is in exile.

